{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/4483e3d7e9852c201c06e3b8654a3d2b.avif?t=1755975395\" width=616 height=322 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST + DEEP </h2>Samurai GUNN 2 is a super fast online platform fighter with stylish moves and lots of cool characters. The unique character movement, wild special abilities, and one-hit-kills make this unlike any platform fighter you\u2019ve ever played before. Simple controls let you have fun with friends right away, but hidden depth allows for exhilarating high level play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/0852f8428a5c270d674311dc17e8c52b.poster.avif?t=1755975395\" width=688 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/0852f8428a5c270d674311dc17e8c52b.webm?t=1755975395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/0852f8428a5c270d674311dc17e8c52b.mp4?t=1755975395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > COOL MOVES + UPDATING CAST OF CHARACTERS</h2>Every character has a completely different moveset and strategy. Run up walls with wolf speed, pick-pocket your opponent\u2019s ammo, turn invisible for that trickster kill, or just sumo toss your friend into a bottomless pit. We are working on lots of new Samurai and even adding in guest characters from fellow indie games like Spelunky, Minit, Rivals of Aether, and Among Us!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/962c9064594b55188f64980745cd86c1.poster.avif?t=1755975395\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/962c9064594b55188f64980745cd86c1.webm?t=1755975395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/962c9064594b55188f64980745cd86c1.mp4?t=1755975395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANGA-IN-A-GAME</h2>Learn the epic backstory of Gunn City in <i>Trigger Soul</i>, a new graphic novel by Valentin Seiche.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/2875f70cd01bc068e0f9be7d8985d85c.poster.avif?t=1755975395\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/2875f70cd01bc068e0f9be7d8985d85c.webm?t=1755975395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/2875f70cd01bc068e0f9be7d8985d85c.mp4?t=1755975395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83c\udfac Directed by <strong>Beau Blyth</strong>, creator of <i>Samurai GUNN</i> and co-creator of <i>Hyper Light Drifter</i><br></li><li> \ud83d\udc7a\u2694\ufe0f\ud83d\udc3a <strong>VERSUS MODE</strong> - Local + Online! 19 VS Stages playable so far.<br></li><li> \ud83d\udca5 <strong>UNIQUE ABILITIES!</strong> - Every character is unique! 12 playable fighters so far.<br></li><li> \ud83d\ude80\ud83e\udd20\ud83d\udc2c\ud83d\udc38 <strong>FRIENDS!</strong> - The Crewmate, Minit, and Ana from <i>Spelunky 2</i>?! Yes! All have unique abilities straight from their original games. Next up is Ranno from Rivals of Aether!<br></li><li> \ud83d\udcd5 <strong>COMIC</strong> - Read <i>Trigger Soul</i>, a ~175 page Samurai Gunn graphic novel by acclaimed French artist Valentin Seiche. Launching with Chapter 1 of 6.<br></li><li> \ud83c\udf08 <strong>FUNN MODE</strong> - This setting tones down the violence and removes the blood for a family-friendly experience.<br></li><li> \ud83c\udfb9 <strong>SOUNDTRACK by DOSEONE</strong> - This game has so much music packed in it. FEEL the rhythm in your blood!<br></li><li> \ud83d\udd25 <strong>A WHOLE NEW LOOK</strong> - Boasting the freshest art and animation from veteran Nelson Boles</li></ul><br>--<br>Welcome the newest character in Samurai GUNN 2:<br><i><strong>The Crewmate from Among Us!</strong></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/ab5d9c27e8ed038656e4e781cc87741b.poster.avif?t=1755975395\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/ab5d9c27e8ed038656e4e781cc87741b.webm?t=1755975395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/ab5d9c27e8ed038656e4e781cc87741b.mp4?t=1755975395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>ID card attacks, trash projectiles, and even vents!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/2a0b2cd4c882c29c749040a54d86a033.poster.avif?t=1755975395\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/2a0b2cd4c882c29c749040a54d86a033.webm?t=1755975395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397790/extras/2a0b2cd4c882c29c749040a54d86a033.mp4?t=1755975395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As a Crewmate, you complete tasks from suspicious DNA Terminals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared